WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:07.800
Our Growing Communities: Ō Tātou Hapori
Whanake

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:15.250
Waimakariri is one of the fastest growing
districts in New Zealand and may near 100,000

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.180
residents over the next 30 years.

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:24.750
The upcoming review of the District Plan will
ensure the district and its townships have

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.039
adequate land zoned for 30 years' growth.

00:00:28.039 --> 00:00:33.320
The District Development Strategy will set
out how and where we grow and plan for appropriate

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.980
infrastructure to support our expanding population.

00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:44.420
Our District - Our Future, Waimakariri 2048
aims to:

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:13.440
So what do you think?

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:18.420
Do you agree with the general growth directions
proposed for our main towns?

00:01:19.360 --> 00:01:23.280
Do you support a greater mix of housing choices
and intensification?

00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:27.320
Let us know your thoughts and find out more
about the District Development Strategy at

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:31.360
Waimakariri.govt.nz

